een both worlds.<br>At the border, there are no easy decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/00aa71661b99afd1fa08734e50d69619.poster.avif?t=1772110124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/00aa71661b99afd1fa08734e50d69619.webm?t=1772110124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/00aa71661b99afd1fa08734e50d69619.mp4?t=1772110124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/df1707bea6956733c09d5aae13161167.avif?t=1772110124\" width=1417 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Daily border shifts</strong> \u2013 Check passports, visas, and belongings under increasing pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Moral dilemmas</strong> \u2013 Obey the regime or follow your conscience. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shifting politics</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new rules, restrictions, and unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic encounters</strong> \u2013 Refugees, spies, smugglers, soldiers, and desperate families - each with unique stories and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic environment and weather</strong> \u2013 Each day looks a little different. The political situation changes, and so do the shapes of the borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Branching outcomes</strong> \u2013 Become a hero of the people, a loyal instrument of the regime, or remain lost in the gray zone between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replay value</strong> \u2013 Treat people differently and experience new endings to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Distinctive style</strong> \u2013 A semi-realistic visual look inspired by <strong>socialist propaganda art</strong> and <strong>Cold War-era paintings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the border, truth is never black and white.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision leaves a mark - on others, and on You.</strong></p>","developers":["Frostember Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/bc35a6754f0622a0cc0d4b8b25d70b20fcb4b4b5/header.jpg?t=1772110124","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034540/1927866039/b7e81a9c28ee8cdd284f4592d88f104c8939b0ec/1771585250/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772110123","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034540/1927866039/b7e81a9c28ee8cdd284f4592d88f104c8939b0ec/1771585250/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772110123","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034540/1927866039/b7e81a9c28ee8cdd284f4592d88f104c8939b0ec/1771585250/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772110123","id":257291029,"name":"Lines We Draw | Official Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291029/425dc50c79ae4c0119a6d97f988d6a0704236455/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772110123"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034540/369589353/5c35bcbe65e4d3b60f372f35a5bd6c08e729d37a/1760276984/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772110124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati